about awkward questions?

318
00:15:56.947 --> 00:15:57.747
The meme?

319
00:15:57.848 --> 00:16:00.649
Heh. no. I want to ask
an awkward. uh.

320
00:16:00.750 --> 00:16:03.586
an icky question.

321
00:16:03.686 --> 00:16:06.156
