what we missed out on.

332
00:16:25.574 --> 00:16:28.778
Very well.
My question is this. Um...

333
00:16:30.513 --> 00:16:32.715
Now I feel it's been
built up to. Uh...

334
00:16:34.217 --> 00:16:35.651
Should I request a drum roll?

335
00:16:35.751 --> 00:16:37.120
