352
00:17:21.764 --> 00:17:23.465
Yeah? Uh...

353
00:17:23.566 --> 00:17:24.533
And what I mean by that

354
00:17:24.633 --> 00:17:26.569
is that we're discussing
a church that

355
00:17:26.669 --> 00:17:28.437
