Not Jack in the Box.

435
00:20:33.089 --> 00:20:34.090
I vote Wendy's.

436
00:20:34.190 --> 00:20:35.158
I could support.

437
00:20:35.258 --> 00:20:37.360
Good! Wendy's it is. Yeah.

438
00:20:37.460 --> 00:20:38.761
Do you know?
