502
00:25:13.102 --> 00:25:14.637
So we need our coats.

503
00:25:14.737 --> 00:25:16.506
Yeah.

504
00:25:16.606 --> 00:25:18.741
-We do.
-I don't know. do we?

505
00:25:18.841 --> 00:25:19.976
Walk back
